      "created_at": "2021-07-29T01:36:03.674Z",
      "cooked": "<p>“frowning_face_with_open_mouth” is definitely broken, as it doesn’t even appear properly in the dropdown to pick smileys.  Its description replaces the space which could have contained eight other smileys; if any other smileys are meant to appear between <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"> and <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/anguished.png?v=9\" title=\":anguished:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":anguished:\">, they aren’t visible now.</p>\n<p>In other news, <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/hot_face.png?v=9\" title=\":hot_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":hot_face:\"></p>",
